        "TileImage": "$($repository 2d68e5af-aa12-4c17-a133-210dc499dcb2).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rWhat appears to be an ordinary resort gathering conceals a dangerous conspiracy. Tourist Vlad Volodin has arranged a secret meeting with Jackie Carrington, a journalist who traded integrity for profit. Guarding them is Ivan Berezovski, a ruthless bodyguard with a history of silencing loose ends. Assisting the operation is groundskeeper Lamom Montri, whose access allows evidence and money to move unnoticed. The client wants all four eliminated.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
